  (cons "- Business and Human Rights Resource Centre, Palantir's response to allegations over the war in Gaza (April 2025), https://business-humanrights.org/en/latest-news/palantir-response-to-the-allegations-over-its-complicity-in-war-crimes-amid-israels-war-in-gaza"
  (cons "- Al Jazeera, Palantir posts otherworldly growth despite criticism over Gaza (August 2026), https://aljazeera.com/news/2026/8/4/tech-giant-palantir-posts-otherworldly-growth-despite-criticism-over-gaza"
  (cons "- Competition is for Losers, Thiel's 2014 Stanford and Y Combinator lecture, https://rosetta.to/u/ycombinator/competition-is-for-losers-with-peter-thiel-how-to-start-a-startup-2014-5"
  (cons "- Wharton, Peter Thiel's notes on startups, https://knowledge.wharton.upenn.edu/article/peter-thiels-notes-on-startups/"
  (cons "- UnHerd, How Peter Thiel became a scapegoat (on Thiel and Girard), https://unherd.com/2021/09/how-peter-thiel-became-a-scapegoat"
  (cons "- Avik Jain, hyperactivity, Part I, the blocks linked above"
